<blockquote>From: Dawnfire</blockquote>
<blockquote>Attn: Mercantile Authority</blockquote>
<blockquote>Thank you for taking the time to look into the matter. We respect that your decision is final. The door is always open, so do keep us abreast of any future work you may have for us.</blockquote>
<blockquote>Regards to the Empress,</blockquote>
<blockquote>Dawnfire Systems (of Murgatary)</blockquote>
